sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as AuthController
    participant S as AccountService
    participant H as IPasswordHasher
    participant J as IJwtTokenGenerator
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    U->>W: Enter email or username and password
    W->>C: POST /api/Auth/login {identifier, password, deviceInfo}
    C->>S: LoginAsync(request)
    S->>R: Find account by email or username
    R->>DB: SELECT ACCOUNTS
    DB-->>R: account
    S->>H: Verify(password, passwordHash)
    alt no account, no password yet or wrong password
        S-->>C: UnauthorizedException (same message for every case)
        C-->>W: 401 Unauthorized
    else account deactivated or banned
        S-->>C: ForbiddenException
        C-->>W: 403 Forbidden
    else valid
        S->>R: PrepareCreate Session, SaveAsync()
        R->>DB: INSERT SESSIONS
        S->>J: Generate JWT (accountId, sessionId, roles)
        S->>S: Log activity signedIn
        S-->>C: LoginResponse
        C-->>W: 200 OK (token)
        W-->>U: Home page of the user's role
    end
    Note over W,C: "Sign in with Google" (POST /api/Auth/google) follows the same path after IGoogleTokenValidator, only an account already linked to that Google account is accepted
